<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#45669f">

  <link rel="stylesheet" href="wedding.css">
  <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="Images/mono.png">
  <link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="Images/mono.png">

  <title>Accommodation | Laura &amp; James' Wedding</title>

  <style>
    .accommodation-header {
      max-width: 760px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 75px 20px 45px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .accommodation-header h1 {
      margin: 8px 0 20px;
      font-family: "Didot", "Cormorant Garamond", serif;
      font-size: 36px;
      font-weight: 400;
      letter-spacing: 7px;
      color: #365a98;
    }

    .accommodation-header > p:last-child,
    .hotel-card p,
    .booking-note,
    .accommodation-footer {
      font-family: "Montserrat", sans-serif;
      font-size: 11px;
      line-height: 1.8;
      color: #6982ae;
    }

    .hotel-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 22px;
      width: min(1000px, 90%);
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .hotel-card {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      box-sizing: border-box;
      min-height: 380px;
      padding: 35px 28px;
      text-align: center;
      background-color: #ffffff;
      border: 1px solid #d9e1ed;
      transition: transform 0.25s ease, box-shadow 0.25s ease;
    }

    .hotel-card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-4px);
      box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(67, 97, 145, 0.12);
    }

    .hotel-icon {
      width: 34px;
      height: 34px;
      margin: 0 auto 16px;
      stroke-width: 1.25;
      color: #7891bb;
    }

    .hotel-card h2 {
      margin: 0 0 12px;
      font-family: "Cormorant Garamond", serif;
      font-size: 21px;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
      color: #45669f;
    }

    .best-for {
      display: inline-block;
      align-self: center;
      margin: 0 0 15px;
      padding: 6px 11px;
      font-family: "Montserrat", sans-serif;
      font-size: 8px !important;
      font-weight: 600;
      line-height: 1.4 !important;
      letter-spacing: 1.1px;
      color: #45669f !important;
      background-color: #eef3fa;
      border-radius: 20px;
    }

    .hotel-location {
      min-height: 40px;
      margin: 0 0 12px;
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    .hotel-description {
      margin: 0;
    }

    .hotel-buttons {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 9px;
      margin-top: auto;
      padding-top: 24px;
    }

    .hotel-buttons a,
    .all-hotels a {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 11px 15px;
      font-family: "Montserrat", sans-serif;
      font-size: 8px;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
      text-decoration: none;
      color: #45669f;
      background-color: #ffffff;
      border: 1px solid #9fb1cf;
      transition: color 0.2s ease, background-color 0.2s ease;
    }

    .hotel-buttons a:hover,
    .all-hotels a:hover {
      color: #ffffff;
      background-color: #45669f;
    }

    .booking-note {
      width: min(760px, 88%);
      margin: 38px auto 0;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .all-hotels {
      margin: 30px auto 45px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .accommodation-footer {
      padding: 35px 20px 55px;
      text-align: center;
      border-top: 1px solid #e1e6ef;
    }

    .accommodation-footer p {
      margin: 0;
    }

    @media (max-width: 800px) {
      .accommodation-header {
        padding: 55px 18px 35px;
      }

      .accommodation-header h1 {
        font-size: 27px;
        letter-spacing: 4px;
      }

      .hotel-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        max-width: 520px;
      }

      .hotel-card {
        min-height: auto;
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 480px) {
      .accommodation-header h1 {
        font-size: 23px;
        letter-spacing: 3px;
      }

      .hotel-card {
        padding: 30px 20px;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>
  <nav class="navbar" aria-label="Main navigation">
    <a href="index.html">HOME</a>
    <a href="information.html">WEDDING INFORMATION</a>
    <a href="accommodation.html" aria-current="page">ACCOMMODATION</a>
  </nav>

  <header class="accommodation-header">
    <p class="small-script">where to stay</p>
    <h1>ACCOMMODATION</h1>
    <p>
      For guests travelling to celebrate with us, we have gathered several
      accommodation options around Baulkham Hills and the surrounding area.
      Each option offers something a little different depending on your needs.
    </p>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="hotel-grid" aria-label="Nearby accommodation options">
      <article class="hotel-card">
        <i class="hotel-icon" data-lucide="hotel" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        <h2>VISY DIOR HOTEL</h2>
        <p class="best-for">BEST FOR: STAYING NEAR THE VENUE</p>
        <p class="hotel-location">1 Columbia Court, Baulkham Hills</p>
        <p class="hotel-description">
          A convenient Norwest hotel for guests who would prefer to stay near
          Cropley House and the surrounding Baulkham Hills area.
        </p>

        <div class="hotel-buttons">
          <a href="https://www.booking.com/searchresults.html?ss=Visy+Dior+Hotel+Baulkham+Hills&amp;checkin=2027-09-10&amp;checkout=2027-09-12&amp;group_adults=2&amp;group_children=0&amp;no_rooms=1" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">CHECK AVAILABILITY</a>
          <a href="https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&amp;destination=Visy+Dior+Hotel+Baulkham+Hills" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">DIRECTIONS</a>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="hotel-card">
        <i class="hotel-icon" data-lucide="building-2" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        <h2>QUEST BELLA VISTA</h2>
        <p class="best-for">BEST FOR: FAMILIES AND GROUPS</p>
        <p class="hotel-location">24 Norbrik Drive, Bella Vista</p>
        <p class="hotel-description">
          Spacious serviced apartments with studio, one-bedroom, two-bedroom
          and three-bedroom options. Many apartments include kitchens, living
          areas and laundry facilities.
        </p>

        <div class="hotel-buttons">
          <a href="https://www.booking.com/hotel/au/quest-bella-vista.html?checkin=2027-09-10&amp;checkout=2027-09-12&amp;group_adults=2&amp;group_children=0&amp;no_rooms=1" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">CHECK AVAILABILITY</a>
          <a href="https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&amp;destination=Quest+Bella+Vista" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">DIRECTIONS</a>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="hotel-card">
        <i class="hotel-icon" data-lucide="cooking-pot" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        <h2>PUNTHILL NORWEST</h2>
        <p class="best-for">BEST FOR: A SELF-CONTAINED WEEKEND</p>
        <p class="hotel-location">22 Brookhollow Avenue, Baulkham Hills</p>
        <p class="hotel-description">
          Apartment-style accommodation with kitchen facilities and a choice
          of studio, one-bedroom and larger apartment configurations.
        </p>

        <div class="hotel-buttons">
          <a href="https://www.booking.com/hotel/au/punthill-norwest.html?checkin=2027-09-10&amp;checkout=2027-09-12&amp;group_adults=2&amp;group_children=0&amp;no_rooms=1" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">CHECK AVAILABILITY</a>
          <a href="https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&amp;destination=Punthill+Norwest" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">DIRECTIONS</a>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="hotel-card">
        <i class="hotel-icon" data-lucide="sparkles" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        <h2>PEPPERS THE HILLS LODGE</h2>
        <p class="best-for">BEST FOR: A BOUTIQUE STAY</p>
        <p class="hotel-location">1 Salisbury Road, Castle Hill</p>
        <p class="hotel-description">
          A boutique hotel with landscaped surroundings, onsite dining and
          complimentary parking for guests wanting a more traditional hotel
          experience.
        </p>

        <div class="hotel-buttons">
          <a href="https://www.booking.com/hotel/au/grand-the-hills-lodge.html?checkin=2027-09-10&amp;checkout=2027-09-12&amp;group_adults=2&amp;group_children=0&amp;no_rooms=1" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">CHECK AVAILABILITY</a>
          <a href="https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&amp;destination=Peppers+The+Hills+Lodge" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">DIRECTIONS</a>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="hotel-card">
        <i class="hotel-icon" data-lucide="train-front" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        <h2>MERCURE SYDNEY ROUSE HILL</h2>
        <p class="best-for">BEST FOR: TRANSPORT AND DINING</p>
        <p class="hotel-location">Commercial Road, Rouse Hill</p>
        <p class="hotel-description">
          A modern hotel near Rouse Hill Metro, Rouse Hill Town Centre and the
          Fiddler dining precinct. A practical option for guests staying for
          several days or travelling without a car.
        </p>

        <div class="hotel-buttons">
          <a href="https://www.booking.com/hotel/au/mercure-sydney-rouse-hill.html?checkin=2027-09-10&amp;checkout=2027-09-12&amp;group_adults=2&amp;group_children=0&amp;no_rooms=1" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">CHECK AVAILABILITY</a>
          <a href="https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&amp;destination=Mercure+Sydney+Rouse+Hill" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">DIRECTIONS</a>
        </div>
      </article>
    </section>

    <p class="booking-note">
      Booking links are pre-filled for Friday 10 September to Sunday
      12 September 2027 for two adults. Guests can change the number of people,
      rooms or dates on Booking.com. Availability may not appear until each
      hotel releases its September 2027 rooms.
    </p>

    <div class="all-hotels">
      <a href="https://www.booking.com/searchresults.html?ss=Cropley+House+Baulkham+Hills&amp;checkin=2027-09-10&amp;checkout=2027-09-12&amp;group_adults=2&amp;group_children=0&amp;no_rooms=1" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">VIEW MORE NEARBY ACCOMMODATION</a>
    </div>
  </main>

  <footer class="accommodation-footer">
    <p>
      These suggestions are provided for convenience. Please book directly
      through your preferred accommodation provider and review its terms.
    </p>
    <div class="venue-heart" aria-hidden="true">♡</div>
  </footer>

  <script src="https://unpkg.com/lucide@latest"></script>
  <script>
    lucide.createIcons();
  </script>
</body>
</html>
